{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write batches of records in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, for an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" to send."}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","modules":[{"name":"CollectorEncoding"}],"externalID":"CollectorEncoding","title":"CollectorEncoding","symbolKind":"module"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BatchEncoder"},{"type":"text","text":" for a self-hosted TraffluentCollector’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/v1\/batches"},{"type":"text","text":". Give it to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":") as its encoder,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and pass the collector’s API key to the destination as an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Authorization: Bearer"},{"type":"text","text":" header field."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The body is JSON: one object per record, with the record’s identifier (which a redelivered record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps), the event’s name, its timestamp, whether it is redelivered, its properties and its context.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Properties are read from the event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" form, which ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" derives, through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event’s schema in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"TrackingPlan","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" the encoder is made with. The context holds the standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context keys the record has values for, its session and sample rate, and its trace context. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value is written only while the record reveals it; once redacted, a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property is left out, and an array’s element, or a value inside a type the plan can’t map, is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"null","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A record the encoder can’t write is left out and the rest of the batch is sent: one whose event and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"version the plan doesn’t describe, one whose event isn’t "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"type":"text","text":", one holding a value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"JSON can’t, such as a NaN, and one whose timestamp has no ISO 8601 form (NaN, infinite, or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"than "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int64.max"},{"type":"text","text":" milliseconds from 1970). "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns each record left out"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SkippedRecord"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), which the destination logs and reports on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dropReports"},{"type":"text","text":". When no record of a batch can be written, the destination sends nothing."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns the same body and skipped records without a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To send to a server of your own format, write a ","type":"text"},{"code":"BatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of your own. To send to PostHog,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostHogBatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostHogEncoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import CollectorEncoding","import HTTPDestinations","import TrackingPlans","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()","let encoder = CollectorBatchEncoder(plan: plan)","let collector = HTTPDestination(","    endpoint: collectorURL,  \/\/ https:\/\/collector.example.com\/v1\/batches","    headerFields: [.authorization: \"Bearer \\(apiKey)\"],","    encoder: encoder)","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: collector)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers sending to the collector beside the other destinations."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/collectorencoding"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Encoding-batches","title":"Encoding batches","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatch"]},{"anchor":"Records-left-out","title":"Records left out","identifiers":["doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorEncodingError"]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding"},"references":{"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","title":"Choosing Destinations","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choosing Destinations"}],"type":"link"},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorEncodingError":{"title":"CollectorEncodingError","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorencodingerror","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CollectorEncodingError"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CollectorEncodingError"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorEncodingError","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Why ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" couldn’t encode a record, which it leaves out of the batch’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request as a ","type":"text"},{"code":"SkippedRecord","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" logs and reports. When it can encode no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record of a batch, it makes no request, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" sends nothing for the batch.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations","title":"HTTPDestinations","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Send each batch of records to an HTTP endpoint, and send it again until it arrives.","type":"text"}]},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding","title":"CollectorEncoding","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding","abstract":[{"text":"Write batches of records in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, for an ","type":"text"},{"code":"HTTPDestination","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to send.","type":"text"}]},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations/BatchEncoder":{"title":"BatchEncoder","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations\/batchencoder","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"BatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What turns a batch of records into the requests "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" sends."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatchEncoder/batch(of:)":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatchencoder\/batch(of:)","title":"batch(of:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batch"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"CollectorBatch","preciseIdentifier":"s:17CollectorEncoding0A5BatchV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The body of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch"},{"type":"text","text":" in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, and the records left out of it."}]},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatchEncoder":{"title":"CollectorBatchEncoder","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatchencoder","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CollectorBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CollectorBatchEncoder","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations\/BatchEncoder","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" of TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, so an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HTTPDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" can send to a self-hosted collector’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"POST \/v1\/batches"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatch":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CollectorBatch"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatch","title":"CollectorBatch","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CollectorBatch"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatch","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A batch as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" encodes it: the body of the records it could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"encode, and the records it left out."}]},"doc://CollectorEncoding/documentation/CollectorEncoding/CollectorBatchEncoder/requests(for:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requests","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BatchRequests","preciseIdentifier":"s:16HTTPDestinations13BatchRequestsV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"CollectorEncodingError","preciseIdentifier":"s:17CollectorEncoding0aB5ErrorO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The one request carrying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"batch"},{"type":"text","text":" in TraffluentCollector’s ingest format, and the records"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"left out of it."}],"title":"requests(for:)","url":"\/documentation\/collectorencoding\/collectorbatchencoder\/requests(for:)","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/requests(for:)"}}}